The pattern is "ab".
The source is "eidbaooo".
The target is sort characters of pattern.
The width is the number of characters in pattern.
The last is the last position of source.
The final is last minus width plus 1.
The found is 0.
For every start from 0 to final.
The finish is start plus width.
The piece is the slice of source from start to finish.
The ordered is sort characters of piece.
If ordered matches target, set found to 1.
If found is 1, stop.

If found is 1, show true, otherwise show false.
